#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:2
#: 4e00dea2be7041058c5ffd16f6830a09
msgid "Taylor-Green Vortex (Convergence Study)"
msgstr "泰勒-格林涡（收敛性研究）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:4
#: 667bc5f91d9a435a80792b412de76202
msgid ""
"The Taylor-Green vortex is the canonical incompressible-flow benchmark with "
"a known exact solution: a periodic decaying vortex on the square :math:`[0, "
"2\\pi]^2` whose velocity and pressure can be written down in closed form. "
"The script ``examples/fluid/taylor_green/taylor_green.py`` uses it to drive "
"a quantitative **h-convergence study** of the transient Taylor-Hood Navier-"
"Stokes solver — the only example in :doc:`index` whose purpose is "
"verification rather than visualization."
msgstr ""
"Taylor-Green 涡是不可压缩流体的经典基准问题，具有已知的精确解：在正方形区域 :math:`[0, 2\\pi]^2` "
"上的一个周期性衰减涡，其速度和压力均可写出闭式表达式。脚本 "
"``examples/fluid/taylor_green/taylor_green.py`` 利用该问题对瞬态 Taylor-Hood Navier-"
"Stokes 求解器进行定量的 **h-收敛性研究** —— 这是 :doc:`index` 中唯一以验证而非可视化为目的的算例。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:16
#: 687d655d742b416ba659d23516d5ea4e
msgid "Exact solution"
msgstr "精确解"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:18
#: b3c39628e3124ad38d9a518b8a85f24a
msgid "For viscosity :math:`\\nu` and time :math:`t`,"
msgstr "对于黏度 :math:`\\nu` 与时间 :math:`t`\\ ，"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:20
#: 08ab08a37e19437e9ee13f438d94d03c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"u(x, y, t) &= -\\cos(x)\\, \\sin(y)\\, e^{-2\\nu t}, \\\\\n"
"v(x, y, t) &= \\phantom{-}\\sin(x)\\, \\cos(y)\\, e^{-2\\nu t}, \\\\\n"
"p(x, y, t) &= -\\tfrac14 \\bigl(\\cos(2x) + \\cos(2y)\\bigr)\\, e^{-4\\nu t}."
msgstr ""
"u(x, y, t) &= -\\cos(x)\\, \\sin(y)\\, e^{-2\\nu t}, \\\\\n"
"v(x, y, t) &= \\phantom{-}\\sin(x)\\, \\cos(y)\\, e^{-2\\nu t}, \\\\\n"
"p(x, y, t) &= -\\tfrac14 \\bigl(\\cos(2x) + \\cos(2y)\\bigr)\\, e^{-4\\nu t}."

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:26
#: 3d7457eea00c4d80ba9220bc4bfd340e
msgid ""
"The velocity decays exponentially with rate :math:`2\\nu` (twice the "
"kinematic viscosity); the pressure decays at rate :math:`4\\nu`. "
"Substitution verifies that :math:`(u, v, p)` satisfies the incompressible "
"Navier-Stokes equations exactly."
msgstr ""
"速度以速率 :math:`2\\nu`\\ （运动黏度的两倍）指数衰减；压力以速率 :math:`4\\nu` 衰减。代入即可验证 :math:`(u,"
" v, p)` 精确满足不可压缩纳维-斯托克斯方程。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/taylor_green.rst:32
#: 387c6a924b9a439eae7ee7d0384f039b
msgid ""
"The script imposes Dirichlet velocities on every boundary node equal to the "
"exact solution at the current time, and pins one pressure DOF to its exact "
"value. This sidesteps the need for periodic boundaries and isolates the "
"discretization error."
msgstr ""
"该脚本在每个边界节点上施加等于当前时刻精确解的狄利克雷速度，并将一个压力自由度固定为其精确值。这避免了周期性边界条件的需求，并分离出离散化误差。"

